<Layout title="Drylining Livingston | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Livingston. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Livingston, West Lothian, and the wider EH54 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/livingston/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Livingston and West Lothian" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Livingston</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Livingston</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Livingston, West Lothian, and the wider EH54 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Livingston provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Livingston (EH54), West Lothian, and the wider area. Experienced with new build housing estates, retail parks, and commercial refurbishments.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Livingston</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Livingston is Scotland's largest new town, situated in West Lothian approximately 15 miles west of Edinburgh city centre on the M8 corridor. The EH54 postcode covers Livingston and its surrounding communities, with a total population of around 56,000. As a planned new town established in the 1960s, Livingston has a unique character — a mix of 1960s and 1970s housing, extensive new build developments, and a thriving commercial and retail centre. The town is home to the large Saughton Park and Roslin Park estates, the Almondell and Calderwood Country Park, and the thriving St James retail district. This diversity means our drylining contractors work on everything from new build pre-completion drylining on housing estates to large-scale retail and office fit-outs in the town centre and business parks.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Livingston's commercial sector continues to expand with new business parks, retail developments, and office spaces, creating consistent demand for professional drylining services. Our Livingston crew covers the entire EH54 postcode and surrounding West Lothian areas, serving both residential and commercial clients. We bring extensive experience with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in Scotland's largest new town — from new build housing developments to large commercial fit-outs. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Livingston</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Livingston-based crew handles everything from new build pre-completion drylining on housing estates to large-scale commercial fit-outs in retail parks and business centres — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the EH54 postcode and West Lothian.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>New build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for residential housing developments across Livingston's expanding estates</li> <li><strong>Retail fit-outs</strong> — Shop fitting, office refurbs, and display wall construction in the St James retail district and surrounding retail parks</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbishments, call centres, and business park drylining across Livingston's expanding commercial sector</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, retail units, and new build apartments throughout West Lothian</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties, student accommodation, and commercial spaces in Livingston and surrounding areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Livingston We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Livingston town centre and St James (EH54)</li> <li>Trafford and Whitehill areas</li> <li>Almond Valley and Saughton Park (EH54)</li> <li>Westfield and Polbeth (EH54)</li> <li>Dechmont and Broomside (EH54)</li> <li>Armadale (EH48)</li> <li>Airth and Linlithgow (EH49)</li> <li>Bathgate (EH48)</li> <li>West Lothian area generally</li> <li>Almondell and Calderwood Park area</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Livingston Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Livingston falls under <strong>West Lothian Council</strong> for building standards and planning. While Livingston is a new town with less heritage protection than Edinburgh's historic centres, there are still listed buildings and conservation areas within the town and surrounding West Lothian area. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a new build housing estate drylining to a commercial fit-out in St James — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Livingston Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across West Lothian, including Livingston, Bathgate, Armadale, and Linlithgow. We understand the unique character of Livingston — from its post-war new town heritage to its ongoing transformation into a thriving commercial and retail hub between Edinburgh and Glasgow. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in a large modern town with significant new build activity. Whether you need drylining for a new build housing estate, a retail fit-out, or a commercial refurbishment, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 30 minutes via M8</li> <li><a href="/areas/glasgow/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Glasgow</a> — 30 minutes via M8</li> <li><a href="/areas/bathgate/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Bathgate</a> — 10 minutes via A804</li> <li><a href="/areas/linlithgow/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Linlithgow</a> — 10 minutes via A89</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Livingston Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Livingston. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Livingston Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:transparent;color:var(--primary);margin-left:0.5rem;">FREEPHONE 0800 820 3090</a> </div> </div></section>  
